+## Chrome Browser Session Workflow
+
+Before inspecting or interacting with an authenticated Google Chrome tab, read
+[chrome-session.md](references/chrome-session.md). Use silent mode by default:
+keep Chrome in the background and target the exact window and tab IDs. Switch
+to visible/handoff mode only when the user explicitly asks to open, show, or
+foreground the exact tab for viewing or manual interaction. Never export
+cookies, browser storage, authorization headers, or tokens. The user must first
+enable:
+
+```text
+View -> Developer -> Allow JavaScript from Apple Events
+```
